Horizontal para-Fibonacci sequence: says which column of Wythoff array (starting column count at 1) contains n.

The 99 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A035612

